    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.poster.avif?t=1754996136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.webm?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.mp4?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build a team of JRPG inspired units with unique abilities. You will need to strategically place and synergize the characters to be successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.poster.avif?t=1754996136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.webm?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.mp4?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battles play turns automatically, where units use their special abilities on specific triggers. There are many unique strategies and powerful synergies to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>ysnc Multiplayer AND Single Player Roguelite\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the Mirrored Legion in a run based rogue lite mode where each run is modified by meta shifting trinkets.<br><br>Or challenge your party comp skills against other player's parties in Arena Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, items, trinkets, and factions after each run.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.poster.avif?t=1754996136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.webm?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/5532ced65c9189483ff999938b39f81c.mp4?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build a team of JRPG inspired units with unique abilities. You will need to strategically place and synergize the characters to be successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.poster.avif?t=1754996136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.webm?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520490/extras/8cbfc04f0d3bcafc4eb1b4be7a4cb498.mp4?t=1754996136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battles play turns automatically, where units use their special abilities on specific triggers. There are many unique strategies and powerful synergies to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>ysnc Multiplayer AND Single Player Roguelite\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the Mirrored Legion in a run based rogue lite mode where each run is modified by meta shifting trinkets.<br><br>Or challenge your party comp skills against other player's parties in Arena Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, items, trinkets, and factions after each run.</p>",
    "short_description": "Assemble a party and master synergies in this Roguelite Auto Battler. Strategically place units and combine their unique abilities to defeat the Mirrored Legion. With game changing trinkets, events, and treasures, no two runs are the same. Adapt and evolve on your quest to reclaim the Mirror Throne!",
